<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 1.31 off UK's FTSE 100 index.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 1.31 off UK's FTSE 100 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>FTSE International Ltd said the following FTSE 100 index stocks will go ex-dividend on Monday and the effect will be to take 1.31 points off the index today.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND    INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)     EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross  Gross</p>
<p>    * Cadbury Schweppes	   5.20  6.50  0.379</p>
<p>    * Schroders			6.00  7.50  0.066</p>
<p>    * Zeneca Group		  12.50 15.625 0.865</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
